OL,3,GNEWSAOwls behind ancient 'feast of
OL,4,Afrogs' mystery
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe culprits behind a massive frog
OL,7,Fcemetery that has baffled scientists
OL,8,Fhave turned out to be a group of
OL,9,Fshort-eared owls.
OL,11,FBetween 2016 and 2018, 8,000 ancient
OL,12,Ffrog bones were discovered in a single
OL,13,Fditch near the site of an Iron Age
OL,14,Froundhouse at Bar Hill, near Cambridge.
OL,16,FScientists at Bournemouth University
OL,17,Fand Museum of London Archaeology (MOLA)
OL,18,Fhave now identified that birds of prey
OL,19,Fwere behind the 1,700 year-old cold
OL,20,Fcase.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
