OL,3,GNEWSAOwls behind ancient 'feast of
OL,4,Afrogs' mystery
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Paul Clarkson, of Bournemouth
OL,7,FUniversity, said people "don't often
OL,8,Fget an owl's eye view of what it was
OL,9,Flike in the past from archaeological
OL,10,Fsites".
